Z||000003||TRiAD||12-19-2001||08:12 PM||||Well, if you read half of the Harry Potter thread, you will see Ray hates Christians because they "impose their beliefs on others" and don't "let everyone live their own lives and make their own decisions". <P>Ray is asking you to help impose HIS ideas on Universal, because he claims "the fast and the furious" soundtrack is "protected" and cannot be copied. <P>Why he'd want to "legally" copy the disc is anyone's guess.<P>Copy-protection is as old as the old giant floppies. It's nothing new, and it's been on many CDs and DVDs for years. Since Ray just heard about it on Rush Limbaugh as some "big brother" thing, it's his newest "cause". <P>Sorry he bothered you, I'm sure Cliff will try to put him back in his cage.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||13
