Z||000028||MinnGreenGT||12-20-2001||01:16 PM||||I just recieved a response from my email.  At least they're quick!<P>----------<BR>From: "MusicHelpOnline Support" &lt;support@musichelponline.com&gt;<BR>Date: Thu, 20 Dec 2001 12:09:49 -0600<BR>To: "Rob C. Bartlett" &lt;rob@xtralite.com&gt;<BR>Subject: RE: Copy Protected CDs<P>Rob,<P>This CD may not be playable in a limited number of CD/CD capable players. UMG is currently working with our technology providers to achieve 100% playability.<P>Should you purchase this CD and experience this problem, you can help us by emailing the model of the player and a description of the problem.<P>Since the current version of the copy-protection technology will only play in PCs running Microsoft® Windows95®, Windows98®, Windows2000®, Windows ME®, Windows XP® or Windows NT 4 ® with Service Pack 4.  We hope to include Macintosh-based playability on copy-protected discs in the future. <P>Music Help Online Support||||reg||1
